diff -Naur -x 'build*' -x '.ninja*' -x subprojects -x '*.o' original_mesa/debian/changelog mesa-26.1.6/debian/changelog
--- original_mesa/debian/changelog	2026-08-06 02:19:20.000000000 -0500
+++ mesa-26.1.6/debian/changelog	2026-09-02 11:18:33.602357345 -0500
@@ -1,3 +1,19 @@
+mesa (26.1.6-1~bpo13+1) trixie-backports; urgency=medium
+
+  * Backport to Debian Trixie (stable).
+  * Relax Build-Depends: llvm-21-dev -> llvm-19-dev, libclang-21-dev ->
+    libclang-19-dev, libclc-21 -> libclc-19, libllvmspirvlib-21-dev ->
+    libllvmspirvlib-19-dev, llvm-spirv-21 -> llvm-spirv-19.
+  * Replace spirv-tools-dev with spirv-tools.
+  * Adapt directx-headers-dev dependency for Trixie compatibility.
+  * Disable native D3D12 driver (-Dgallium-d3d12-graphics=disabled,
+    -Dgallium-d3d12-video=disabled) to avoid LLVM 19 incompatibilities.
+  * Patch: path_max.diff (GNU/Hurd compatibility).
+  * Patch: src_glx_dri_common.h.diff (forward declaration for __GLXDRIdrawable).
+
+ -- stornic56 <stornic56@proton.me>  Thu, 02 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0200
+
 mesa (26.1.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium
 
   * New upstream release.
